  "knowledge": "Specific Yield",
  "description": "Measures the energy output of a solar plant relative to its rated power capacity over a period.",
  "definition": "A measure of energy productivity, calculated as: $Y_{S} = \\frac{E_{out}}{P_{rated}}$, where $E_{out}$ is the total energy yielded (in kWh) and $P_{rated}$ is the plant's rated power capacity (in kW)."
}

